<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Reprogramar cita · DocTotal</title><style>:root{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}body{margin:0;background:#f5f7fb;color:#1f2937}.wrap{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}.card{width:min(100%,680px);background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:20px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 16px 50px rgba(15,23,42,.08)}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748b}h1{margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:28px}h2{font-size:17px}.muted{color:#64748b}.detail{margin:22px 0;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc}.detail strong{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:18px}.section{margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb}.date-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap}label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}input[type=date]{border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 12px;font:inherit}.btn{border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block}.dark{background:#111827;color:#fff}.light{background:#eef2ff;color:#4338ca;border:1px solid #c7d2fe}.slots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(96px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.slot{width:100%;background:#fff;color:#3730a3;border:1px solid #c7d2fe}.empty{padding:18px;border-radius:14px;background:#fffbeb;color:#92400e}.error{margin-top:8px;color:#be123c;font-size:13px}</style></head><body><div class="wrap"><main class="card"><div class="eyebrow">DocTotal · Cita</div><h1>Reprogramar mi cita</h1><p class="muted">Selecciona una fecha y después uno de los horarios realmente disponibles.</p><div class="detail"><span class="muted">Horario actual</span><strong>{{ $appointment->starts_at->format('d/m/Y H:i') }}</strong>@if($appointment->doctorProfile)<p class="muted">Profesional: {{ $appointment->doctorProfile->first_name }} {{ $appointment->doctorProfile->last_name }}</p>@endif</div><section class="section"><h2>1. Selecciona una fecha</h2><form method="GET" action="{{ route('public.appointments.show',['token'=>$token]) }}"><input type="hidden" name="reschedule" value="1"><div class="date-row"><div><label for="date">Fecha</label><input id="date" type="date" name="date" min="{{ now()->format('Y-m-d') }}" value="{{ old('date',$date) }}" required></div><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Ver horarios</button></div></form>@error('date')<div class="error">{{ $message }}</div>@enderror</section><section class="section"><h2>2. Elige un horario</h2><p class="muted">Duración de la cita: {{ $duration }} minutos.</p>@error('time')<div class="error">{{ $message }}</div>@enderror@if(count($availableSlots))<div class="slots">@foreach($availableSlots as $slot)<form method="POST" action="{{ route('public.appointments.cancel',['token'=>$token]) }}">@csrf<input type="hidden" name="_action" value="reschedule"><input type="hidden" name="date" value="{{ $date }}"><input type="hidden" name="time" value="{{ $slot }}"><button class="btn slot" type="submit">{{ $slot }}</button></form>@endforeach</div>@else<div class="empty">No hay horarios disponibles para esta fecha. Selecciona otro día.</div>@endif</section><p style="margin-top:22px"><a class="btn light" href="{{ route('public.appointments.show',['token'=>$token]) }}">Volver a mi cita</a></p></main></div></body></html>